# Performance Guidelines

## Backend Performance
- Use async/await for I/O bound operations
- Reuse HTTP clients and database connections
- Cache expensive operations (vector embeddings, AI calls)
- Implement connection pooling for external services

## Frontend Performance
- Use React.memo, useMemo, useCallback judiciously
- Implement virtualization for large lists/graphs
- Use dynamic imports for code splitting large components
- Monitor bundle size and optimize imports
- Implement proper loading states to improve perceived performance
